      "message": "fix(2d): name the stock band narrower than the tool around the part\n\nA pocket-family op (2D Pocket, Adaptive, Offset) that clears the stock\naround the part (whole-model source, #12, or stock source with parts,\n#1554) gave a band of that area narrower than the tool no pass and said\nnothing: pocket_entered refuses only a region that erodes to nothing as\na whole. The op now carries a note that names each such band by its XY\nbox, with the tool diameter and the stock to leave. The cut does not\nchange; the check never blocks it.\n\nmachining2d::unreached_pieces / unreached_note (camcraft-motion) find\nthe connected pieces that erode to nothing by the tool radius plus the\nstock to leave; keep_law::narrow_noted adds the note.\n\nPinned by narrow_band (app) and machining2d::unreached::law (motion).\n\nFixes #1655\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
